      "cwe_id": "CWE-639",
      "explanation": "The change explicitly fixes a potential IDOR (Insecure Direct Object Reference) vulnerability. Previously, `delete_api_key` did not verify ownership, allowing any authenticated user to delete any API key by ID. The updated code adds an ownership check (`if api_key.user_id != user_id`) and raises an error if the user does not own the key. The route handler also correctly passes the `current_user.id` to the CRUD function.",
